    "summary": "ARES GUNSHIP errata, **Infernus Firebombs** rewritten: as your **[Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase)** ends, pick one enemy unit this unit can see within 24\", other than **AIRCRAFT** or **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)** units. That unit loses the **[benefit of cover](vsdata:core-rule/benefit-of-cover)**, a loss lasting until your following **[Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase)** has finished, and you roll one D6 per model in it, each 6 inflicting 1 **[mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)** on it.",
